{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01103",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.89,
      "end_seconds": 5.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Hi, doctor, I hope I'm not disturbing you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.34,
      "end_seconds": 10.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "So, no problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.9,
      "end_seconds": 22.68,
      "duration_seconds": 7.78,
      "text": "Honestly, it's a tight band around my head, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.54,
      "end_seconds": 30.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.61,
      "end_seconds": 37.65,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "It's aspirin, 75 milligrams, once a day for my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.04,
      "end_seconds": 42.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.56,
      "end_seconds": 48.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.62,
      "text": "One week, I think... sorry, two weeks, I got that wrong."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.85,
      "end_seconds": 53.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Does anything set it off?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.97,
      "end_seconds": 60.64,
      "duration_seconds": 5.67,
      "text": "Yes, long screen days and stress. That makes it worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.68,
      "end_seconds": 65.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "How strong would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.94,
      "end_seconds": 68.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "It's mild, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.17,
      "end_seconds": 73.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "So, have you tried anything for it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.27,
      "end_seconds": 78.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "I get some relief from a warm shower."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.55,
      "end_seconds": 82.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.47,
      "end_seconds": 93.78,
      "duration_seconds": 10.31,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get a stiff neck as well. The stiff neck? That's been for four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.38,
      "end_seconds": 100.96,
      "duration_seconds": 6.58,
      "text": "Have you had a tight band around your head before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.25,
      "end_seconds": 107.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "A bit, last year. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.89,
      "end_seconds": 109.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "How about sickness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.92,
      "end_seconds": 113.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "I haven't noticed any sickness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.09,
      "end_seconds": 120.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.71,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any weakness, sensitivity to light or blurred vision?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.55,
      "end_seconds": 127.08,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "No weakness, sensitivity to light or blurred vision, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.99,
      "end_seconds": 136.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Right, on the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.89,
      "end_seconds": 142.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "My heart's been fine, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.08,
      "end_seconds": 150.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.46,
      "end_seconds": 157.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "No allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.16,
      "end_seconds": 162.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.34,
      "end_seconds": 166.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "My mother had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.85,
      "end_seconds": 170.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.29,
      "end_seconds": 175.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "I've had heart disease for nearly five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.8,
      "end_seconds": 179.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.55,
      "end_seconds": 199.29,
      "duration_seconds": 18.74,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. My partner and our baby. I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.07,
      "end_seconds": 211.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.37,
      "end_seconds": 223.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.25,
      "end_seconds": 242.02,
      "duration_seconds": 7.77,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 15, blood pressure 126 over 78, saturation 99 percent. And heart rate 77."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.36,
      "end_seconds": 248.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.57,
      "end_seconds": 250.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.48,
      "end_seconds": 271.9,
      "duration_seconds": 6.42,
      "text": "Your neck and shoulder muscles are tight, and your eye movements are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.51,
      "end_seconds": 276.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.12,
      "end_seconds": 289.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Taking everything into account, this is probably tension-type headache."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 289.57,
      "end_seconds": 291.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.08,
      "end_seconds": 300.9,
      "duration_seconds": 7.82,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like tension-type headache, but I'd like to confirm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.59,
      "end_seconds": 318.64,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "I want an eye test done, that's for eye strain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 320.0,
      "end_seconds": 322.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "How long will it take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.74,
      "end_seconds": 343.92,
      "duration_seconds": 20.18,
      "text": "Take screen breaks every hour and try regular neck stretches. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. Please don't wait if the headache becomes sudden and severe. That's when to be seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.67,
      "end_seconds": 348.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Alright, I follow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.4,
      "end_seconds": 352.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "See me again in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 353.18,
      "end_seconds": 355.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "I can manage that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 359.56,
      "end_seconds": 364.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 366.79,
      "end_seconds": 370.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 371.69,
      "end_seconds": 373.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "So, have a good day."
    }
  ]
}